{"ref":"BDB, פְּלֹנִי²","hw":"פְּלֹנִי²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלֹנִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלוֹנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> erron.: c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפְּלוֹנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.27\">1 Ch 11:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.10\">27:10</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפַּלְטִי</span> as <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.26\">2 S 23:26</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּית פָּ֑לֶט\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּית פָּ֑לֶט\", dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית פָּ֑לֶט</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפְּלֹנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.36\">1 Ch 11:36</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגִּלֹנִי</span>, as <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.34\">2 S 23:34</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלֹנִי</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, פְּלֹנִי\" href=\"/BDB,_פְּלֹנִי\", dir=\"rtl\">פלה</a>.","next":"BDB, פלס","prev":"BDB, פַּלְמֹנִי"}